    {
      "id": "tt12872898:1:27",
      "title": "Last 2",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 27,
      "number": 27,
      "released": "2021-05-20T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Now that it has been discovered that Çelebi is really alive, he starts looking for a way of leaving the country. While Ömer turns to his dark side willing to do whatever it takes to prevent Çelebi from leaving the country, a totally unexpected person supports his actions as well. As Cemre runs to be by Ozan's side as he is taken into surgery, she runs into the very angry Seher. Cemre will not return to the neighborhood because she is afraid of Çelebi, she makes a move that attracts the attention of the media. While Tomris and her team are doing everything that they can for Ozan during surgery, all of the eyes and ears of the Yedikule neighborhood will be on alert.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt12872898/1/27/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 2947368
    },
    {
      "id": "tt12872898:1:28",
      "title": "Final",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 28,
      "number": 28,
      "released": "2021-05-27T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "After Ömer is caught the end has also come for Çelebi. After all of the evil things that he has done the time has come for him to be punished and pay the price. Now Cemre without any fear can take the first steps in starting a new life, but when Hanım's husband is released from prison panic strikes. With the totally unexpected move made by Çiçek; İskender and Çiçek take the test for eternal love. Rüya's happy news makes everyone especially Ömer very happy. As the love between Altan and Tomris starts to bloom, the face to face meeting between Tomris and Çiçek is going to change Çiçek's life forever. And finally the extinguisher is about to put out the remaining heat in the ashes, and is also about to clear the smoke from everyone's lives.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt12872898/1/28/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 2947370
    },
